    "content_html": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img alt=\"experiences-machu-picchu-travel-tips-peru-cusco\" class=\"wp-image-1063\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"576\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"https://www.gtperutravel.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/experiencias-machu-picchu-travel-tips-peru-cusco-1024x576.jpg\" srcset=\"https://www.gtperutravel.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/experiencias-machu-picchu-travel-tips-peru-cusco-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://www.gtperutravel.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/experiencias-machu-picchu-travel-tips-peru-cusco-300x169.jpg 300w, https://www.gtperutravel.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/experiencias-machu-picchu-travel-tips-peru-cusco-768x432.jpg 768w, https://www.gtperutravel.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/experiencias-machu-picchu-travel-tips-peru-cusco.jpg 1200w\" style=\"width:414px;height:auto\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">experiences-machu-picchu-travel-tips-peru-cusco</figcaption></figure>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"cu-al-es-la-mejor-hora-para-visitar-machu-picchu\"> What is the best time to visit Machu Picchu?</h3>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> <strong>Quick answer:</strong><br/>The best time to visit Machu Picchu is between 6:00 am and 9:00 am. During this time you will find fewer tourists and ideal light for taking photos.</p>\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"por-qu-e-es-importante\"> Why is it important?</h3>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As the day progresses, the number of visitors increases considerably. This can lead to a slower ride, more lines, and a reduced quality of experience.</p>\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"consejo-adicional\"> Additional tip</h3>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Travel between April and October (dry season) for the best chance of clear skies and best views.</p>\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"recomendaci-on\"> Recommendation</h3>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you are looking for a quieter and more organized experience, it is best to book a tour early.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> <strong>See recommended tour:</strong><br/> <a href=\"https://www.gtperutravel.com/tour/template-tour.php?tour=machupicchu&amp;lang=es\">Machu Picchu Full Day</a></p>\n",
